#: ../../kpoints/kpoint_convergence.rst:3
msgid "k点はいくつ必要か：金属Cuと半導体Siの収束"
msgstr ""
"How Many k-Points Are Needed? Convergence for Metallic Cu and "
"Semiconducting Si"

#: ../../kpoints/kpoint_convergence.rst:5
msgid ""
"周期結晶の電子状態計算では、入力に「k点メッシュ」を指定します。\\ "
"粗いメッシュでも計算結果は得られますが、定性的に誤った結果になることがあります。\\ "
"収束した結果を得るにはk点を十分に増やす必要がありますが、メッシュを細かくするほど計算時間は長くなります。\\ "
"このページでは、k点の意味を説明し、計算事例を通じて必要なk点数の目安を示します。"
msgstr ""
"Electronic structure calculations for periodic crystals require a k-point"
" mesh as input. \\ Even a coarse mesh yields a result, but the result can"
" be qualitatively wrong. \\ A converged result requires sufficiently many"
" k-points, but a finer mesh takes longer to compute. \\ This page "
"explains what k-points are and uses this calculation example to show "
"roughly how many are needed."

#: ../../kpoints/kpoint_convergence.rst:23
msgid "k点メッシュ"
msgstr "k-Point Mesh"

#: ../../kpoints/kpoint_convergence.rst:25
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"結晶の全エネルギーや電子密度を求めるには、各バンド・各波数 :math:`\\boldsymbol{k}` "
"の状態からの寄与を占有数で重み付けて、ブリルアンゾーン（BZ）全体にわたって積分する必要があります。\\ "
"実際の計算では、この積分を、BZを規則正しく覆う有限個のk点、つまり **k点メッシュ** での値の平均で近似します。"
msgstr ""
"To obtain the total energy or electron density of a crystal, we weight "
"the contribution from each band at each wave vector "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{k}` by its occupation number and integrate over the "
"Brillouin zone (BZ). \\ In practice, we approximate this integral by "
"averaging the values at a finite set of k-points that regularly sample "
"the BZ. This set is the **k-point mesh**."

#: ../../kpoints/kpoint_convergence.rst:28
msgid ""
"\\frac{1}{\\Omega_\\mathrm{BZ}}\\int_\\mathrm{BZ} "
"A(\\boldsymbol{k})\\,\\mathrm{d}\\boldsymbol{k}\n"
"\\;\\approx\\;\n"
"\\frac{1}{n^3}\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{k}\\in\\text{メッシュ}} A(\\boldsymbol{k})\n"
"\\;=\\;\n"
"\\sum_{i} w_i\\,A(\\boldsymbol{k}_i)"
msgstr ""
"\\frac{1}{\\Omega_\\mathrm{BZ}}\\int_\\mathrm{BZ} "
"A(\\boldsymbol{k})\\,\\mathrm{d}\\boldsymbol{k}\n"
"\\;\\approx\\;\n"
"\\frac{1}{n^3}\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{k}\\in\\text{mesh}} A(\\boldsymbol{k})\n"
"\\;=\\;\n"
"\\sum_{i} w_i\\,A(\\boldsymbol{k}_i)"

#: ../../kpoints/kpoint_convergence.rst:37
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
":math:`\\Omega_\\mathrm{BZ}` はBZの体積、 :math:`n` はBZを各方向に等分する数です。\\ 今回は、 "
":math:`\\Gamma` 点を含む（オフセットなしの） :math:`n\\times n\\times n` メッシュを使います。\\ "
"最後の形は、対称性で等価な点をまとめた既約k点 :math:`\\boldsymbol{k}_i` と重み :math:`w_i` による和です（"
" :numref:`{number}節 <sec-kp-irreducible>` ）。"
msgstr ""
":math:`\\Omega_\\mathrm{BZ}` is the volume of the BZ, and :math:`n` is "
"the number of equal divisions along each direction. \\ Here we use a "
":math:`\\Gamma`-centered (unshifted) :math:`n\\times n\\times n` mesh. \\"
" The final expression is a sum over irreducible k-points "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{k}_i`, one from each group of symmetry-equivalent "
"points, with weights :math:`w_i` (:numref:`Section {number} <sec-kp-"
"irreducible>`)."

#: ../../kpoints/kpoint_convergence.rst:41
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"和で積分を近似する精度は、被積分関数 :math:`A(\\boldsymbol{k})` がどれだけ滑らかかで決まります。\\ "
"半導体・絶縁体では、占有バンドがBZ全体で占有されたままなので被積分関数は滑らかで、和は :math:`n` "
"とともに指数関数的に速く収束するはずです。\\ "
"金属では、フェルミ面を境に占有数が1から0へ飛ぶため、被積分関数に段差があり、収束は遅く、誤差は符号を変えながら減ると予想されます。\\ "
"この段差を扱うために、占有数をなめらかにする **スメアリング** や、段差を含んだまま積分を近似する **テトラヘドロン法** が使われます。"
msgstr ""
"The accuracy of the sum as an approximation to the integral depends on "
"how smooth the integrand :math:`A(\\boldsymbol{k})` is. \\ In "
"semiconductors and insulators, occupied bands remain occupied throughout "
"the BZ, so the integrand is smooth and the sum should converge "
"exponentially fast as :math:`n` increases. \\ In metals, the occupation "
"number jumps from 1 to 0 across the Fermi surface, creating a "
"discontinuity in the integrand. Convergence is therefore expected to be "
"slow, with the error changing sign as its magnitude decreases. \\ Two "
"ways to handle the discontinuity are **smearing**, which smooths the "
"occupation numbers, and the **tetrahedron method**, which approximates "
"the integral with the discontinuity still present."

#: ../../kpoints/kpoint_convergence.rst:46
msgid ""
"許されるk点が結晶の周期性からどう決まるかは技術ノートの\\ `ブロッホの定理と周期境界条件 <https://technical-"
"notes.quemix.com/solid/blochstheorem.html#pbc-wavevector-count>`__\\ "
"に、等間隔の点の和の誤差が何で決まるかは\\ `k点メッシュと積分誤差 <https://technical-"
"notes.quemix.com/solid/kpoint_sampling.html>`__\\ "
"に、スメアリングとテトラヘドロン法の考え方は\\ `金属のブリルアンゾーン積分 <https://technical-"
"notes.quemix.com/solid/metal_bz_integration.html>`__\\ にまとめました。\\ "
"このページでは、これらの予想を、CuとSiの実際の計算で確かめます。"
msgstr ""
"In the Technical Notes, the section on \\ `Bloch’s theorem and periodic "
"boundary conditions <https://technical-"
"notes.quemix.com/solid/blochstheorem.html#pbc-wavevector-count>`__ \\ "
"explains how crystal periodicity determines the allowed k-points. The "
"note on \\ `k-point meshes and integration error <https://technical-"
"notes.quemix.com/solid/kpoint_sampling.html>`__ \\ explains what governs "
"the error in a sum over equally spaced points. The note on \\ `Brillouin "
"zone integration for metals <https://technical-"
"notes.quemix.com/solid/metal_bz_integration.html>`__ \\ explains the "
"ideas behind smearing and the tetrahedron method. \\ On this page we test"
" these predictions using calculations for Cu and Si."

#: ../../kpoints/kpoint_convergence.rst:50
msgid "計算対象と計算条件"
msgstr "Systems and Calculation Conditions"

#: ../../kpoints/kpoint_convergence.rst:52
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"計算するのは、面心立方（fcc）構造のCuと、ダイヤモンド構造のSiです。\\ どちらも原始胞（Cuは1原子、Siは2原子）を使います。\\ "
"原始胞は、3辺の長さが立方晶の格子定数 :math:`a` の :math:`1/\\sqrt{2}` "
"で、辺のなす角がすべて60°のセルです。\\ 以下では、格子の大きさを立方晶の格子定数 :math:`a` で表します。"
msgstr ""
"We studied Cu in the face-centered cubic (fcc) structure and Si in the "
"diamond structure. \\ We used primitive cells for both (1 atom for Cu and"
" 2 atoms for Si). \\ In each primitive cell, all three edges have a "
"length equal to the cubic lattice constant :math:`a` multiplied by "
":math:`1/\\sqrt{2}`. All angles between the edges are 60°. \\ Below, we "
"express the size of the lattice in terms of the cubic lattice constant "
":math:`a`."

#: ../../kpoints/kpoint_convergence.rst:57
msgid ""
"格子定数は、Cuが3.60、3.64、3.68 Å、Siが5.42、5.47、5.52 Åの3通りです。\\ "
"いずれもPBE汎関数で求まる格子定数の付近の値で、格子定数を変えたときのエネルギー差と圧力も調べるために3通り用意しました。\\ "
"k点メッシュは、BZを各方向に :math:`n` 等分した :math:`n\\times n\\times n` のメッシュで、 "
":math:`n` を変えて計算します。\\ 計算は平面波基底の第一原理計算コードQuantum ESPRESSO（QE） [1]_ [2]_ "
"で行い、条件を :numref:`tab-kp-conditions` にまとめました。"
msgstr ""
"We used three lattice constants for each material: 3.60, 3.64, and 3.68 Å"
" for Cu and 5.42, 5.47, and 5.52 Å for Si. \\ These values are close to "
"the lattice constants obtained with the PBE functional. We used three "
"values to examine the energy differences and pressures as the lattice "
"constant changes. \\ We divided the BZ into :math:`n` equal parts along "
"each direction to form an :math:`n\\times n\\times n` k-point mesh and "
"varied :math:`n` across the calculations. \\ We ran the calculations with"
" Quantum ESPRESSO (QE) [1]_ [2]_, a first-principles code that uses a "
"plane-wave basis. :numref:`tab-kp-conditions` lists the calculation "
"conditions."

