"擬ポテンシャルのファイルは、Cuが ``Cu.pbe-dn-kjpaw_psl.1.0.0.UPF`` 、Siが "
"``Si.pbe-n-kjpaw_psl.1.0.0.UPF`` です。\\ "
"MVはMarzari–Vanderbiltの略で、スメアリングについては :numref:`{number}節 <sec-kp-"
"smearing>` で説明します。\\ Cuの3.64 Åでは、スメアリング幅を0.005、0.01、0.04 Ryに変えた計算も行います。\\"
" Cuでは、スメアリングのかわりにテトラヘドロン法を使った計算も行い、 :numref:`{number}節 <sec-kp-tetra>` "
"で比べます。\\ SCFの収束閾値を :math:`10^{-12}` Ryと厳しくしているのは、圧力を比べるためです。\\ "
"圧力（応力）は全エネルギーより収束が遅く、 :math:`10^{-9}` Ryでは、Cuの圧力が計算の設定により約1 kbarばらつきました（ "
":doc:`reproduction` の「計算と数値を扱う上での注意」）。\\ "
"以下では、エネルギーは1原子あたりの値をmeVで、圧力はQEの出力どおりkbar（10 kbar = 1 GPa）で示します。"
msgstr ""
"The pseudopotential files are ``Cu.pbe-dn-kjpaw_psl.1.0.0.UPF`` for Cu "
"and ``Si.pbe-n-kjpaw_psl.1.0.0.UPF`` for Si. \\ MV stands for "
"Marzari–Vanderbilt. We explain smearing in :numref:`Section {number} "
"<sec-kp-smearing>`. \\ For Cu at 3.64 Å, we also ran calculations with "
"smearing widths of 0.005, 0.01, and 0.04 Ry. \\ For Cu we also ran "
"calculations with the tetrahedron method in place of smearing and compare"
" the results in :numref:`Section {number} <sec-kp-tetra>`. \\ We set a "
"tight SCF convergence threshold of :math:`10^{-12}` Ry so we could "
"compare pressures. \\ Pressure (stress) converges more slowly than total "
"energy. At :math:`10^{-9}` Ry, the Cu pressure varied by about 1 kbar "
"depending on the calculation settings (see “Notes on Calculations and "
"Numerical Results” in :doc:`reproduction`). \\ Below, we give energies in"
" meV per atom. For pressure, we use kbar (10 kbar = 1 GPa), following the"
" QE output."

#: ../../kpoints/kpoint_convergence.rst:109
#: ../../kpoints/kpoint_convergence.rst:173
msgid "既約k点"
msgstr "Irreducible k-Points"

#: ../../kpoints/kpoint_convergence.rst:111
msgid ""
"結晶に対称性があると、全エネルギーのようなスカラー量の被積分関数は、対称操作で互いに移り合うk点で等しくなります。\\ "
"そこで、メッシュの点を対称操作で移り合う組に分け、各組から1点（既約k点）だけを計算して、組の点の数に比例する重み :math:`w_i` "
"をかけて足します（式 :eq:`kp-bz-average` の最後の形）。\\ "
"fccのCuとダイヤモンド構造のSiは、どちらも48個の対称操作を持つ立方晶の点群に属します。\\ :numref:`tab-kp-"
"irreducible-4` は、Cuの :math:`4\\times4\\times4` "
"メッシュ（64点）を、QEが8個の既約k点にまとめた結果です。"
msgstr ""
"If the crystal has symmetry, the integrand of a scalar quantity such as "
"the total energy is identical at k-points related by symmetry operations."
" \\ We therefore group the mesh points by symmetry, calculate only one "
"point (an irreducible k-point) from each group, and sum the contributions"
" with weights :math:`w_i` proportional to the number of points in the "
"group (the final expression in Equation :eq:`kp-bz-average`). \\ Both fcc"
" Cu and diamond-structure Si belong to a cubic point group with 48 "
"symmetry operations. \\ :numref:`tab-kp-irreducible-4` shows how QE "
"reduced the :math:`4\\times4\\times4` mesh for Cu (64 points) to 8 "
"irreducible k-points."

